    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/1a885c120e0331287770b7635a55aab6.poster.avif?t=1754545913\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/1a885c120e0331287770b7635a55aab6.webm?t=1754545913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/1a885c120e0331287770b7635a55aab6.mp4?t=1754545913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Hell-fungus spreads, polluting the land.\u00a0</strong>The Pebble King leads a brave knight clan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five Pebbles rise as chaos nears.\u00a0Night falls fast. Forget your fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When darkness comes, the battle begins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/d1ce1135edb2ea108b7a076d1f93da93.avif?t=1754545913\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/69c92fadc908c16f5788ea0e43e71327.poster.avif?t=1754545913\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/69c92fadc908c16f5788ea0e43e71327.webm?t=1754545913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/69c92fadc908c16f5788ea0e43e71327.mp4?t=1754545913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm better gear. Master wild skills.\u00a0Dig up ores, upgrade your Kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight together, flip the fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Better hurry, night falls faster than you think!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/0a1a7a11564ba9f4c8c4622c7d7b0760.avif?t=1754545913\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/177d303e65bad96228baf2c649399297.poster.avif?t=1754545913\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/177d303e65bad96228baf2c649399297.webm?t=1754545913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/177d303e65bad96228baf2c649399297.mp4?t=1754545913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mold monsters are filthy strong.\u00a0Boss molds? Disgustingly brutal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stand together or get crushed into pebble dust!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Kingdom\u2019s fate is in your hands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/50d35c63c51fb79ed7e2df0eadd6abe1.avif?t=1754545913\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/ec320da1468606f29c02d42489954b8a.poster.avif?t=1754545913\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/ec320da1468606f29c02d42489954b8a.webm?t=1754545913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/ec320da1468606f29c02d42489954b8a.mp4?t=1754545913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>See something sparkly? Pick it up.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can lift it, it\u2019s a weapon.\u00a0Throw it, swing it, or eat it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush the Mold of Doom however you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/c7c64cc4c3c5121902f583d80f342e07.avif?t=1754545913\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/6bbadb59b6f58b18e013e86e1b2cea29.poster.avif?t=1754545913\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/6bbadb59b6f58b18e013e86e1b2cea29.webm?t=1754545913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/6bbadb59b6f58b18e013e86e1b2cea29.mp4?t=1754545913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One moment, peace.\u00a0The next, chaos.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight the nights! Pebble Knights! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
